{
  "name": "Sentinel",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Guardian.</strong> Immediately after a creature within 5 feet of you takes the Disengage action or hits a target other than you with an attack, you can make an Opportunity Attack against that creature.</p><p><strong>Halt.</strong> When you hit a creature with an Opportunity Attack, the creature’s Speed becomes 0 for the rest of the current turn.</p><section id=\"secret-KBMBiIjYcMO6SlX6\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which can be used for reducing the creature's Speed to 0. </p></section>",
